{"unit_id":"saul-dsh__dsh-prompt-enhancer#card-zh","repo":"saul-dsh/dsh-prompt-enhancer","commit":"21d758f85f2494fa92cac699f4936742dad110a6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-enhancer 是面向 DSH Web 对话框的提示词改写插件。它通过发送前拦截和输入框旁的 ✨ 按钮调用当前模型路由，把粗略需求改写为更清楚、具体且自包含的提示词；用户可选 Low、High、Max 强度，也可用 enhance_prompt 工具手动改写。它适合希望在发送前整理需求、减少歧义的 DSH 用户。可配置自动增强、语言、风格和会话上下文；改写调用使用会话或显式配置的模型路由。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:277-354","index.js:540-579","client.js:750-775"]}
{"unit_id":"saul-dsh__dsh-prompt-enhancer#card-en","repo":"saul-dsh/dsh-prompt-enhancer","commit":"21d758f85f2494fa92cac699f4936742dad110a6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-prompt-enhancer rewrites rough requests in the DSH web composer before they reach the model. It offers a ✨ button, optional send interception, three intensities, and an enhance_prompt tool. Language, style, and recent context are configurable. Rewrites use the current or configured model.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:277-354","index.js:540-579","client.js:750-775"]}
