{"unit_id":"saul-dsh__dsh-prompt-enhancer#feature-send-rewrite","repo":"saul-dsh/dsh-prompt-enhancer","commit":"21d758f85f2494fa92cac699f4936742dad110a6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-enhancer 的功能「发送前自动改写」：启用输入框自动增强后，点击发送或按 Enter 会先请求改写，再将结果放回草稿并提交；改写失败时会发送原文。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:395-410","index.js:698-719"]}
