{"unit_id":"saul-dsh__dsh-prompt-enhancer#feature-tool","repo":"saul-dsh/dsh-prompt-enhancer","commit":"21d758f85f2494fa92cac699f4936742dad110a6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-enhancer 的功能「模型调用改写工具」：注册 enhance_prompt 工具，接收必填的原始提示词并返回改写文本；模型路由可使用显式配置或最近会话路由。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:559-579","index.js:387-420"]}
{"unit_id":"saul-dsh__dsh-prompt-enhancer#feature-context","repo":"saul-dsh/dsh-prompt-enhancer","commit":"21d758f85f2494fa92cac699f4936742dad110a6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-enhancer 的功能「参考最近对话」：开启 useContext 后，改写请求可以带会话标识并引用缓存的最近一轮用户与助手文本，用于消解代词指代。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:165-211","index.js:703-708"]}
{"unit_id":"saul-dsh__dsh-prompt-enhancer#caveat-llm","repo":"saul-dsh/dsh-prompt-enhancer","commit":"21d758f85f2494fa92cac699f4936742dad110a6","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-enhancer 使用前须知：每次成功改写都会额外调用一次 DSH 模型路由；需有可用的会话路由，或配置 provider 与 model。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:277-309","index.js:698-708"]}
